sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Boot as SpringApplication
    participant WSC as WebSocketConfig
    participant RC as RedisConfig
    participant Broker as In-Memory STOMP Broker
    participant SockJS as SockJS Handler
    participant RML as RedisMessageListenerContainer
    participant MLA as MessageListenerAdapter
    participant RS as RedisSubscriber
    participant RT as RedisTemplate
    participant CT as ChannelTopic(chatChannel)

    Boot->>WSC: @Configuration 빈 초기화
    Note over WSC: @EnableWebSocketMessageBroker 활성화

    WSC->>SockJS: registerStompEndpoints(registry)
    Note over SockJS: /gyeonggi_partners-chat 엔드포인트 등록 (SockJS 폴백 포함)

    WSC->>Broker: enableSimpleBroker("/topic")
    Note over Broker: /topic/** 구독자에게 메시지 브로드캐스트 담당

    WSC->>Broker: setApplicationDestinationPrefixes("/app")
    Note over Broker: /app/** 를 @MessageMapping 핸들러로 라우팅

    Boot->>RC: @Configuration 빈 초기화

    RC->>RT: redisTemplate(RedisConnectionFactory)
    Note over RT: Key=StringRedisSerializer, Value=GenericJackson2JsonRedisSerializer

    RC->>CT: channelTopic()
    Note over CT: 모든 채팅 메시지가 오가는 단일 Redis 채널

    RC->>MLA: messageListenerAdapter(RedisSubscriber)
    Note over MLA: handleMessage() 연결, StringRedisSerializer로 역직렬화

    RC->>RML: redisMessageListenerContainer(connectionFactory, listenerAdapter, channelTopic)
    Note over RML: chatChannel 비동기 리스닝 시작